  "aiContextParagraph": "A wave of support has formed for Sufmi Dasco Ahmad, the Daily Chairperson of the Gerindra Party and Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives, as a potential vice-presidential candidate. Numerous regional Gerindra chapters, including those in North Kalimantan, Bali, Southeast Sulawesi, and Papua Pegunungan, have formally endorsed his candidacy. Proponents emphasize his extensive experience in parliament, arguing that he possesses the necessary skills to support the president and bridge communication between the government and the public. Beyond his own party, figures from the NasDem Party and labor union leadership have also publicly backed his inclusion in the vice-presidential selection process, citing his integrity and proven record in managing national stability. These endorsements reflect a growing consensus among various political factions regarding his potential role in the current national administration.",
